# {{NAME}}

{{NAME}} is a software product built on the [{{FOUNDATION_NAME}}]({{FOUNDATION_URL}}) engineering foundation. Its product scope has not been recorded yet; define it under [PJ-02](docs/project/implementation-plan.md#current-work) and replace this introduction.

## Current state

This repository was initialized on {{DATE}} from {{FOUNDATION_NAME}} commit `{{BASELINE}}`. It contains the foundation's architecture, policies, accepted ADRs, tooling, validation gate, CI, generated references, and internal [Living Documentation Portal](apps/web/README.md#living-documentation-portal), and no product modules yet: the API serves only health endpoints and the web application shows its shell. The complete portal remains available in local development; production builds exclude it and its generated assets by default. Product help and public API documentation require separately approved sources and application-owned presentation under [the documentation policy](docs/architecture/living-documentation.md#documentation-audiences-and-publication). A concrete authentication provider and production environment have not been selected.

The [project plan](docs/project/implementation-plan.md) and [project human actions](docs/project/human-actions.md) own this repository's current work and external prerequisites. The [project manifest](.orion/project.json) records the project identity, the immutable initialization commit, and the {{FOUNDATION_NAME}} baseline currently integrated. [Project derivation](docs/project-derivation.md) explains how to inspect provenance and adopt newer {{FOUNDATION_NAME}} revisions through reviewed merges.

